[{"title":"赴戍登程口示家人二首 其一","author":"林则徐","text":"出门一笑莫心哀，浩荡襟怀到处开。\n时事难从无过立，达官非自有生来。\n风涛回首空三岛，尘壤从头数九垓。\n休信儿童轻薄语，嗤他赵老送灯台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1220,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赴戍登程口示家人二首 其二","author":"林则徐","text":"力微任重久神疲，再竭衰庸定不支。\n苟利国家生死以，岂因祸福避趋之。\n谪居正是君恩厚，养拙刚于戍卒宜。\n戏与山妻谈故事，试吟断送老头皮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1221,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"程玉樵方伯德润饯予于兰州藩廨之若已有园次韵奉谢二首 其二","author":"林则徐","text":"我无长策靖蛮氛，愧说楼船练水军。\n闻道狼贪今渐戢，须防蚕食念犹纷。\n白头合对天山雪，赤手谁摩岭海云。\n多谢新诗赠珠玉，难禁伤别杜司勋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1222,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题双松山馆二律","author":"林则徐","text":"停车未共长官亲，诗句先惊入眼新。\n滴露已纫骚客佩，干云合拟大夫身。\n漫论桂树前头影，要识甘棠著手春。\n有约归来恣吟啸，冬心话与岁寒人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1223,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题双松山馆二律","author":"林则徐","text":"署邮特地送秋涛，山馆双虬对影号。\n倚槛浑忘行役苦，成阴曾费主人劳。\n徂徕结侣根原固，泰岱分封节并高。\n知是丁公勤爱护，梦中奚止兆三刀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1224,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏题外子写照","author":"林颀","text":"爱君笔底有烟霞，自拔金钗付酒家。\n修到人间才子妇，不辞清瘦似梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1225,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大桥墓下","author":"范当世","text":"草草征夫往月归，今来墓下一沾衣。\n百年土穴何须共，三载秋坟且汝违。\n树木有生还自长，草根无泪不能肥。\n泱泱河水东城暮，伫与何人守落晖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1226,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过泰山下","author":"范当世","text":"生长海门狎江水，腹中泰岱亦峥嵘。\n空馀揽辔雄心在，复此当前黛色横。\n蜒蜿痴龙怀宝睡，蹒跚病马踏砂行。\n嗟余即逝天高处，开阖云雷傥未惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1227,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚望","author":"郑珍","text":"向晚古原上，悠然太古春。\n碧云收去鸟，翠稻出行人。\n水色秋前静，山容雨后新。\n独怜溪左右，十室九家贫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1228,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰","author":"郑燮","text":"此是幽贞一种花，不求闻达只烟霞。\n采樵或恐通来径，更写高山一片遮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1229,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由兴化迂曲至高邮七绝句","author":"郑燮","text":"烟蓑雨笠水云居，鞋样船儿帽样庐。\n卖取青钱沽酒得，乱摊荷叶摆鲜鱼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1230,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江晴","author":"郑燮","text":"雾裹山疑失，雷鸣雨未休。\n夕阳开一半，吐出望江楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1231,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹","author":"郑燮","text":"一节复一节，千枝攒万叶。\n我自不开花，免撩蜂与蝶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1232,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"郑燮","text":"几家活计卖青山，石块堆来锦绣斑。\n薄暮回车人半醉，乱雅声里唱歌还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1233,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画菊与某官留别","author":"郑燮","text":"进又无能追又难，宦途局蹐不堪看。\n吾家颇有东篱菊，归去秋风耐岁寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1234,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绍兴","author":"郑燮","text":"丞相纷纷诏敕多，绍兴天子只酣歌。\n金人欲送徽钦返，其奈中原不要何！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1235,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盆兰","author":"郑燮","text":"春兰未了夏兰开，万事催人莫要呆；阅尽荣枯是盆盎，几回拔去几回栽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1236,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"峭壁兰","author":"郑燮","text":"峭壁一千尺，兰花在空碧。\n下有采樵人，伸手折不得。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1237,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔家","author":"郑燮","text":"卖得鲜鱼二百钱，米粮炊饭放归船。\n拔来湿苇烧难着，晒在垂杨古岸边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1238,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潍县署中画竹呈年伯包大中丞括","author":"郑燮","text":"衙斋卧听萧萧竹，疑是民间疾苦声。\n些小吾曹州县吏，一枝一叶总关情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1239,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题屈翁山诗札、石涛石溪八大山人山水","author":"郑燮","text":"国破家亡鬓总皤，一囊诗画作头陀。\n横涂竖抹千千幅，墨点无多泪点多！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1240,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画兰","author":"郑燮","text":"兰草已成行，山中意味长。\n坚贞还自抱，何事斗群芳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1241,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画竹","author":"郑燮","text":"两枝修竹出重霄，几叶新篁倒挂梢。\n本是同根复同气，有何卑下有何高！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1242,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画竹","author":"郑燮","text":"四十年来画竹枝，日间挥写夜间思。\n冗繁削尽留清瘦，画到生时是熟时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1243,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得南闱捷音","author":"郑燮","text":"忽漫泥金入破篱，举家欢喜又增悲。\n一枝桂影功名小，十载征途发达迟。\n何处宁亲唯哭墓，无人对镜懒窥帷。\n他年纵有毛公檄，捧入华堂却慰谁？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1244,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠袁枚","author":"郑燮","text":"晨星断雁几文人，错落江河湖海滨。\n抹去春秋自花实，逼来霜雪更枯筠。\n女称绝色邻夸艳，君有奇才我不贫。\n不买明珠买明镜，爱他光怪是先秦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1245,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山中雪后","author":"郑燮","text":"晨起开门雪满山，雪晴云淡日光寒。\n檐流未滴梅花冻，一种清孤不等闲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1246,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"予告归里，画竹别潍县绅士民","author":"郑燮","text":"乌纱掷去不为官，囊橐萧萧两袖寒。\n写取一枝清瘦竹，秋风江上作钓竿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1247,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"郑燮","text":"水流曲曲树重重，树里春山一两峰。\n茅屋深藏人不见，数声鸡犬夕阳中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1248,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏雪","author":"郑燮","text":"一片两片三四片，五六七八九十片。\n千片万片无数片，飞入梅花都不见。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1249,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游白狼山两首","author":"郑燮","text":"悬岩小阁碧梧桐，似有人声在半空。\n百叩铜环浑不应，松花满地午荫浓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1250,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道情十首 其二","author":"郑燮","text":"老樵夫，自砍柴，捆青松，夹绿槐，茫茫野草秋山外。\n丰碑是处成荒冢，华表千寻卧碧苔。\n坟前石马磨刀坏，倒不如、闲钱沽酒，醉醺醺、山径归来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1251,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道情十首 其五","author":"郑燮","text":"老书生，白屋中，说黄虞，道古风，许多后辈高科中。\n门前仆从雄如虎，陌上旌旗去似龙。\n一朝势落成春梦，倒不如、蓬门僻巷，教几个、小小蒙童。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1252,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道情十首 其三","author":"郑燮","text":"老头陀，古庙中，自烧香，自打钟，兔葵燕麦闲斋供。\n山门破落无关锁，斜日苍黄有乱松。\n秋星闪烁颓垣缝，黑漆漆、蒲团打坐，夜烧茶、炉火通红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1253,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道情十首 其八","author":"郑燮","text":"邈唐虞，远夏殷，卷宗周，入暴秦，争雄七国相兼并。\n文章两汉空陈迹，金粉南朝总废尘。\n李唐赵宋慌忙尽，最可叹、龙盘虎踞，尽销磨、燕子春灯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1254,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道情十首 其一","author":"郑燮","text":"老渔翁，一钓竿，靠山崖，傍水湾，扁舟来往无牵绊。\n沙鸥点点轻波远，荻港萧萧白昼寒。\n高歌一曲斜阳晚，一霎时、波摇金影，蓦抬头、月上东山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1255,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道情十首 其九","author":"郑燮","text":"吊龙逢，哭比干，羡庄周，拜老聃，未央宫里王孙惨。\n南来薏苡徒兴谤，七尺珊瑚只自残。\n孔明枉作那英雄汉，早知道、茅庐高卧，省多少、六出祁山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1256,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题竹石","author":"郑燮","text":"咬定青山不放松，立根原在破岩中；千磨万击还坚韧，任尔东西南北风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1257,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题半盆兰蕊图","author":"郑燮","text":"盆画半藏，兰画半含。\n不求发泄，不畏凋残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1258,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沁园春","author":"郑燮","text":"花亦无知，月亦无聊，酒亦无灵。\n把夭桃斫断，煞他风景；鹦哥煮熟，佐我杯羹。\n焚砚烧书，椎琴裂画，毁尽文章抹尽名。\n荥阳郑，有慕歌家世，乞食风情。\n单寒骨相难更。\n笑席帽青衫太瘦生。\n看蓬门秋草，年年破巷；疏窗细雨，夜夜孤灯。\n难道天公、还钳恨口，不许长叹一两声？\n颠狂甚，取乌丝百幅，细写凄清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1259,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 方景两先生庙","author":"郑燮","text":"乾坤欹侧，藉豪英几辈，半空撑住。\n千古龙逢源不死，七窍比干肺腑。\n竹杖麻衣，朱袍白刃，朴拙为艰苦。\n信心而出，自家不解何故。\n也知稷契皋夔，闳颠散适，岳降维申甫。\n彼自承平吾破裂，题目原非一路。\n十族全诛，皮囊万段，魂魄雄而武。\n世间鼠辈，如何妆得老虎！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1260,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 长干里","author":"郑燮","text":"逶迤曲巷，在春城斜角，绿杨荫里。\n赭白青黄墙砌石，门映碧溪流水。\n细雨饧箫，斜阳牧笛，一径穿桃李。\n风吹花落，落花风又吹起。\n更兼处处缲车，家家社燕，江介风光美。\n四月樱桃红满市，雪片鲥鱼刀。\n淮水秋清，钟山暮紫，老马耕闲地。\n一丘一壑，吾将终老于此。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1261,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 台城","author":"郑燮","text":"秋之为气，正一番风雨，一番萧瑟。\n落日鸡鸣山下路，为问台城旧迹。\n老蔓藏蛇，幽花贱血，坏堞零烟碧。\n有人牧马，城头吹起觱篥。\n当初面代牺牲，食惟菜果，恪守沙门律。\n何事饿来翻掘鼠，雀卵攀巢而吸？\n再曰荷荷，跏趺竟逝，得亦何妨失？\n酸心硬语，英雄泪在胸臆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1262,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 石头城","author":"郑燮","text":"悬岩千尺，借欧刀吴斧，削成城郭。\n千里金城回不尽，万里洪涛喷薄。\n王浚楼船，旌麾直指，风利何曾泊。\n船头列炬，等闲烧断铁索。\n而今春去秋来，一江烟雨，万点征鸿掠。\n叫尽六朝兴废事，叫断孝陵殿阁。\n山色苍凉，江流悍急，潮打空城脚。\n数声渔笛，芦花风起作作。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1263,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 劳劳亭","author":"郑燮","text":"劳劳亭畔，被西风一吹，逼成衰柳。\n如线如丝无限恨，和风和烟。\n江上征帆，尊前别泪，眼底多情友。\n寸言不尽，斜阳脉脉凄瘦。\n半生图利图名，闲中细算，十件常输九。\n跳尽胡孙妆尽戏，总被他家哄诱。\n马上旌笳，街头乞叫，一样归乌有。\n达将何乐？\n穷更不如株守。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1264,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 孝陵","author":"郑燮","text":"东南王气，扫偏安旧习，江山整肃。\n老桧苍松盘寝殿，夜夜蛟龙来宿。\n翁仲衣冠，狮麟头角，静锁苔痕绿。\n斜阳断碣，几人系马而读。\n闻说物换星移，神山风雨，夜半幽灵哭。\n不记当年开国日，元主泥人泪簇。\n蛋壳乾坤，丸泥世界，疾卷如风烛残。\n老僧山畔，烹泉只取一掬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1265,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 宏光","author":"郑燮","text":"宏光建国，是金莲玉树，后来狂客。\n草木山川何限痛，只解征歌选色。\n燕子衔笺，春灯说谜，夜短嫌天窄。\n海云分付，五更拦住红日。\n更兼马阮当朝，高刘作镇，犬豕包巾帻。\n卖尽江山犹恨少，只得东南半壁。\n国事兴亡，人家成败，运数谁逃得？\n太平隆万，此曹久已生出。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1266,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 周瑜宅","author":"郑燮","text":"周郎年少，正雄姿历落，江东人杰。\n八十万军飞一炬，风卷滩前黄叶。\n楼舻云崩，旌旗电扫，射江流血。\n咸阳三月，火光无此横绝。\n想他豪竹哀丝，回头顾曲，虎帐谈兵歇。\n公瑾伯符天挺秀，中道君臣惜别。\n吴蜀交疏，炎刘鼎沸，老魅成奸黠。\n至今遗恨，秦淮夜夜幽咽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1267,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 桃叶渡","author":"郑燮","text":"桥低红板，正秦淮水长，绿杨飘撇。\n管领春风陪舞燕，带露含凄惜别。\n烟软梨花，雨娇寒食，芳草催时节。\n画船箫鼓，歌声缭绕空阔。\n究竟桃叶桃根，古今岂少，色艺称双绝？\n一缕红丝偏系左，闺阁几多埋没。\n假使夷光，苎萝终老，谁道倾城哲？\n王郎一曲，千秋艳说江楫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1268,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 胭脂井","author":"郑燮","text":"辘辘转转，把繁华旧梦，转归何处？\n只有青山围故国，黄叶西风菜圃。\n拾橡瑶阶，打鱼宫沼，薄暮人归去。\n铜瓶百丈，哀音历历如诉。\n过江咫尺迷楼，宇文化及，便是韩擒虎。\n井底胭脂联臂出，问尔萧娘何处？\n清夜游词，后庭花曲，唱彻江关女。\n词场本色，帝王家数然否？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1269,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 莫愁湖","author":"郑燮","text":"鸳鸯二字，是红闺佳话，然乎否否？\n多少英雄儿女态，酿出祸胎冤薮。\n前殿金莲，后庭玉树，风雨催残骤。\n卢家何幸，一歌一曲长久！\n即今湖柳如烟，湖云似梦，湖浪浓于酒。\n山下藤萝飘翠带，隔水残霞舞袖。\n桃叶身微，莫愁家小，翻借词人口。\n风流何罪？\n无荣无辱无咎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1270,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇 高座寺","author":"郑燮","text":"暮云明灭，望破楼隐隐，卧钟残院。\n院外青山千万叠，阶下流泉清浅。\n鸦噪松廊，鼠翻经匣，僧与孤云远。\n空梁蛇脱，旧巢无复归燕。\n可怜六代兴亡，生公宝志，绝不关恩怨。\n手种菩提心剑戟，先堕释迦轮转。\n青史讥弹，传灯笑柄，枉作骑墙汉。\n恒沙无量，人间劫数自短。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1271,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"满江红 思家","author":"郑燮","text":"我梦扬州，便想到扬州梦我。\n第一是隋堤绿柳，不堪烟锁。\n潮打三更瓜步月，雨荒十里红桥火。\n更红鲜冷淡不成圆，樱桃颗。\n何日向，江村躲；何日上，江楼卧。\n有诗人某某，酒人个个。\n花径不无新点缀，沙鸥颇有闲功课。\n将白头供作折腰人，将毋左。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1272,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"踏莎行·无题","author":"郑燮","text":"中表姻亲，诗文情愫，十年幼小娇相护。\n不须燕子引人行，画堂到得重重户。\n颠倒思量，朦胧劫数，藕丝不断莲心苦。\n分明一见怕销魂，却愁不到销魂处。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1273,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿野庙","author":"金人瑞","text":"众响渐已寂，虫于佛面飞。\n半窗关夜雨，四壁挂僧衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1274,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪","author":"金圣叹","text":"天公丧母地丁忧，万里江山尽白头。\n明日太阳来作吊，家家檐下泪珠流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1275,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过小孤山","author":"金农","text":"古县萧条对岸开，大江行色榜人催。\n水多风处轻抬眼，浮出青山似覆杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1276,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桃源忆故人 松峦峰","author":"侯文曜","text":"有时云与高峰匹，不放松峦历历。\n望里依岩附壁，一样黏天碧。\n有时峰与晴云敌，不许露珠轻滴。\n别是娇酣颜色，浓淡随伊力。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1277,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感昔","author":"侯怀风","text":"黄河流水响潺潺，当日腥风战血殷。\n大地尽抛金锁甲，长星乱落玉门关。\n居延蔓草萦枯骨，太液芙蓉失旧颜。\n成败百年流电疾，苍梧遗恨不堪攀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1278,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和阮亭《秋柳》诗原韵 其二","author":"冒襄","text":"红闺紫塞昼飞霜，顾影羞窥白玉塘。\n近日心情惟短笛，当年花絮已空箱。\n梦残舞榭还歌榭，泪落岐王与薛王。\n回首三春攀折苦，错教根种善和坊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1279,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和阮亭《秋柳》诗原韵 其一","author":"冒襄","text":"南浦西风合断魂，数枝清影立朱门。\n可知春去浑无迹，忽地霜来渐有痕。\n家世凄凉灵武殿，腰肢憔悴莫愁村。\n曲中旧侣如相忆，急管哀筝与细论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1280,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行","author":"姚鼐","text":"布谷飞飞劝早耕，春锄扑扑趁初晴。\n千层石树通行路，一带水田放水声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1281,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜抵枞阳","author":"姚鼐","text":"轻帆挂与白云来，棹击中流天倒开。\n五月江声千里客，夜深同到射蛟台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1282,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望庐山","author":"姚鼐","text":"我行昨出庐山西，藤竹苍苍阴虎溪。\n东林钟声晚出寺，高崖木叶秋平溪。\n白云万叠倏然合，窈眇回听清猿啼。\n洪州三月忆惝惚，径驾归艇轻于翳。\n宫亭湖东日初出，岚彩欲见一片青。\n烟迷沧州淼漭万余里，岩风忽落闻天鸡。\n屏风叠开张，浸入颇黎。\n沧海贯石梁，白日挂丹梯。\n松杉上接瀑布落，藤萝下拂云光低。\n须臾湖波兴，日晦风凄凄。\n香炉峰，摇曳同菰稗。\n舟行望远势还出，矫如踏云浮动之苍霓。\n山摇海荡不知处，想见枕石醉卧人如泥。\n晚泊湖心照南斗，仰视正与石门齐。\n莫言灵境近咫尺，帆樯倏过难攀跻。\n将游天地之一气，庐山从我到处如提携。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1283,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]